  "summary": "Shorewood (MN) City Council on March 9, 2026 requested that the South Lake Minnetonka Police Department turn off the Flock Safety camera located in Shorewood pending completion of an independent biennial audit required under Minnesota Statutes 13.824. The camera has been deactivated, and the Council plans to revisit Flock use after the audit, expected in May.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "The Council requested the South Lake Minnetonka Police Department turn off this camera until the completion of an independent audit of the Department's compliance procedures and use.",
      "paragraph_idx": 0
    },
    {
      "quote": "The camera has been turned off and Council plans to revisit the use of Flock following the audit, which is expected to be completed in May.",
      "paragraph_idx": 0
    }
  ],
